OL,3,GNEWSATrain cancellations ongoing after
OL,4,Awires damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain cancellations between
OL,7,FCambridgeshire and Norfolk due to
OL,8,Fdamaged overhead wires means are due to
OL,9,Fcontinue until mid-morning, a railway
OL,10,Fcompany said.
OL,12,FTrain operator Great Northern said the
OL,13,Fdamage happened between Ely in
OL,14,FCambridgeshire and King's Lynn on
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
