OL,3,GNEWSATrain cancellations ongoing after
OL,4,Awires damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FLines reopened on Wednesday, however,
OL,7,Fsome services have been cancelled
OL,8,Fbetween King's Lynn and London King's
OL,9,FCross, with rail replacement buses
OL,10,Foperating between King's Lynn and Ely
OL,11,Fand disruption expected until 10:00
OL,12,FBST.
OL,14,FSignalling issues on Tuesday also led
OL,15,Fto Greater Anglia cancellations between
OL,16,FNorwich and Great Yarmouth and
OL,17,FSheringham, in Norfolk, and between
OL,18,FNorwich and Lowestoft, in Suffolk.
OL,19,FHowever, services resumed 16:00.
